@baseUrl = http://localhost:5119/api

### Create Sale - Success
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "branchId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 10.50
    }
  ]
}

